16
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:30,500
 And after the tour, they always say, you know, the Bible becomes alive and colorful now.

17
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:34,900
 So back to the Apostle's Creed, our faith is based on historical events that really

18
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:41,800
 happened.

